      "anti_toolbox_hits": [],
      "notes": "Mode A brand-faithful: palette and type pinned to captured surface (sage #728e7f, gold #eed366/#f8e1af, Comfortaa, Sacramento). Captured text color was pure #000; softened to warm near-black #1a1a17 as a Mode A+ legibility refinement on the cream ground (documented per proposed-file-shell § brand-faithful pure-black inheritance). Captured background #fdfefa is already near-white (not pure). Darker sage/gold tokens added ONLY to meet WCAG AA on small text/borders; hero/large uses stay on the captured hues."
